            <div class="step7-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?> Archetype - Conclusion</h2>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/joy.png">                
                <p>Frustratingly loveable is the word we would use if we were limited to just two to describe the Hero archetype.  It’s hard to stay mad at somebody for too long who has such selfless tendencies toward wanting to help others even if they like to bask in the glory too.  </p>
                <p>The Hero might come across as selfish occasionally but that’s far from the truth.  They are always fighting for the greater cause and their intentions are always good - even if it doesn’t always seem that way to others.  </p>
                <p>It’s just that the Hero Archetype has one big battle with themselves to overcome, it’s one that they will win if they face the challenge but whether the Hero can find the courage to face this battle will remain entirely up to them. </p>
                <p>What you have read so far is just an introduction and a tiny portion of what we can tell you about The Hero Archetype. It doesn’t matter where you are, as a Hero in your journey, whether you’ve already heard your ‘call to action’ and may have started to implement the changes you must make to achieve ‘equilibrium.’  Or whether you have found this report to be eye-opening from the offset.  </p>
                <p>The thing is, we ‘get you,’ we know your call to action, we know the lessons you have to learn and how you might respond to them, and if you felt as though we understood you, that was because we do.  </p>
                <p>We know how to help you to uncover and reconcile the hidden aspects of your ‘self’ so that when you do, all internal conflict fades away and what is left behind is a balanced, whole and strong individual who can navigate life on their own terms while continuing to help people.  </p>
                <p>We have spent years understanding the Hero Archetype, and Jung spent many years too.   We continue to learn more about you and update our content as you send in your life stories and experiences.</p>
                <p>Slowly and surely, we have understood how Heroes think, why they do what they do and what they need to discover to reach their full potential.  </p>
                <p>This is how we know that many of the challenges you’ve faced and will face in the future have been and can be reconciled, even if you cannot see how at this moment in time.  </p>
                <p>But to reconcile your ‘self,’ YOU need to understand more about yourself, you need to discover your little (and big) idiosyncracies so that you can understand them, accept them and work with them, or change them (if they do not serve you).  </p>
                <p>Life is fleeting, and you don’t have to live your life denying your dreams and ideals - you don’t have to live with the eternal conflict of caring for yourself and caring for others, you don’t have to leave YOU and your needs behind.  You can do both; you just need to learn how.</p>
                <p>To learn how, you need to go much deeper into your psyche, and start to uncover the secrets that you keep even from yourself, you need to learn about the secret lives of your unexpressed world, and understand how your underworld can cause conflict in your reality - and then you need to learn how to reconcile it.  </p>
                <p>Once you’ve learned about your hidden self, you need to protect your newly found sense of wholeness.  You can do this by learning how hidden forces influenced by timing, affect different phases of your life, forces that are seeking to achieve wholeness and are prompting you to reconcile parts of yourself so that you can feel complete; this is called the process of individuation.  </p>
                <p>Most people, don’t realize that these forces exist and then when they walk into problems in later life they are completely mystified as to how the new challenges they face came about!  If you can develop an awareness of these factors, and build strategies into your life to reconcile them as part of the individuation process -  before they decide to alert you to their needs you will maintain a harmonious life and continue to work toward your goals.  </p>
                <p>The Premium Archetype Analysis will help you develop an awareness of the depths of your soul, and it’s needs, and then it presents you with coping strategies and resources to help you satisfy your deepest desires so that you feel utterly fulfilled.</p>
                <p>Are you ready to learn what really drives you as a Hero? What secretly motivates and inspires you? And what you are afraid of? </p>
                <p>Are you ready to learn how you can unlock your true potential, while also staying true to who you are?</p>
                <p>But here’s the caveat, It’s not for everyone – you need to be willing to challenge yourself, to face your fears, you’ll need to admit to parts of yourself that you may not pride yourself in, and to ask and answer questions you haven’t asked yourself before.  But if you do this, then you start to accept all of yourself, or you’ll find the resources to make the changes that you feel that you need to make so that you can accept yourself and then with that acceptance, you start to grow, and steer your life to one that you have only ever imagined before.</p>
                <p>The Premium Archetype Analysis is not a quick-fix solution, nor an easy shortcut.  But it will present you with the keys to unlocking your ‘self’ and finding out who you are, and then it will help you create a road-map for creating who you want to be in the future - realistically without any hidden forces driving you in the wrong direction.
                <p>Are you ready to go deeper than you've ever gone before?</p>
